{"name": "Negative Space", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"372\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/6edbec3a2d04781f71843d8c5e37ad21.poster.avif?t=1763747547\" width=\"662\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/6edbec3a2d04781f71843d8c5e37ad21.webm?t=1763747547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/6edbec3a2d04781f71843d8c5e37ad21.mp4?t=1763747547\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><br/><i>Negative Space</i> is a <strong>deckbuilder</strong> without traditional combat. Instead, you\u2019ll build a synergistic crew to maximize their effort output, navigate uncharted planets, weather unpredictable crises, and capitalize on timely boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"370\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/ca5f7ac97021fe7cc02daa8f044a395e.poster.avif?t=1763747547\" width=\"660\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/ca5f7ac97021fe7cc02daa8f044a395e.webm?t=1763747547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/ca5f7ac97021fe7cc02daa8f044a395e.mp4?t=1763747547\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assemble Your Crew</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you journey through the galaxy, you\u2019ll encounter a plethora of crewmembers\u2014each with a unique ability to add to your deck. By combining their effects with your chosen Captain, you'll need to explore distant planets and collect enough stars to complete your mission before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras_big/d4df19621495fcde83051798885f507b.avif?t=1763747547\" height=\"448\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/d4df19621495fcde83051798885f507b.avif?t=1763747547\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Power of Trinkets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete difficult missions and you\u2019ll earn powerful trinkets that shape your strategy and evolve your playstyle. Their benefits may not be obvious at first glance, so you'll need to experiment. Unexpected combinations can propel your deck into the next universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"370\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/828f2d0092cbe38dde5de31c644c0dd0.poster.avif?t=1763747547\" width=\"660\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/828f2d0092cbe38dde5de31c644c0dd0.webm?t=1763747547\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/extras/828f2d0092cbe38dde5de31c644c0dd0.mp4?t=1763747547\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 100 crew cards and 50 game-changing trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5 Captains with unique abilities and signature trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless replayability\u2014no two runs are ever the same</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hand-crafted, colorful galaxy to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delightful and surprising chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical gameplay where every decision matters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock higher difficulty with an Ascension system after victory</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "A whimsical roguelike deckbuilder with rich card interactions and deep synergies. Strategize through perilous space missions by assembling powerful crewmates and gadgets. Can you beat your objectives before time runs out?", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3624300/20a9b437b70f159aee29bfa5c020acef858dd879/header.jpg?t=1763747547", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Roguelike", "Deckbuilding", "Card Battler", "Strategy", "Tactical", "Roguelite"], "developers": "Tier 87 Games", "publishers": "Tier 87 Games", "release_date": "Nov 21, 2025", "price": "$7.99", "appid": "3624300", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "19 May 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/bWa8ssqHoWo", "first_seen": 1747612800.0, "review_rank": 1653}